  "description": "This package provides the Cloud implementation of 51Degrees IP Intelligence for the Pipeline API. It uses a hosted 51Degrees service to enrich incoming requests with IP address information, including geographic location and Autonomous System Number (ASN). Use this package when you want IP Intelligence without running a local on-premise engine, as an alternative to legacy IP Intelligence services such as MaxMind or IPinfo.",
